# This project builds only on Linux.  Forcing LF in the working tree keeps the
# Makefile and the shell scripts runnable when the repo is cloned on Windows —
# a CRLF in a Makefile recipe or a shebang line is a silent, confusing failure.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.c   text eol=lf
*.h   text eol=lf
*.sh  text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.md  text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
